        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED, or NOT COVERED by our current technical stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, here are the assessments for each requirement: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with existing systems of information: our has experience with API integration, including REST, GraphQL, SOAP, and CMIS standards, as well as API gateways like Kong and Apigee. our also have expertise in integrating with electronic management of documents (GED) systems such as Alfresco, Maarch Courrier, and OpenKM." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this requirement is FULLY COVERED. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with business softwares: our has experience with ERP/CRM connectors for SAP, Salesforce, Oracle, Ciril/ARPÈGE, and OXALIS. experience with ERP/CRM connectors for SAP, Salesforce, Oracle, Ciril/ARPÈGE, and OXALIS suggests that our can integrate with various business software systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hence, this requirement is FULLY COVERED. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with electronic management of documents (EDM): As mentioned earlier, our has experience with GED systems like Alfresco, Maarch Courrier, and OpenKM." ;
